      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The Faceless gladly accepts your help. After treating his wounds as much as he is able to, he gives you another, livelier nod; his chances of a successful retreat now seem much better.

Still, he remains silent.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
