      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Hanging above the chasm, an injured Faceless stands locked in a sturdy metal cage. He seems badly injured, with blood dripping from his open wounds and feeding the blackness below. Slowly lifting his head, he looks at you calmly, making no unnecessary movements nor producing a single sound.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
